{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026glnqo5YcgG1794524942.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在美國買賣的港股預託證券，與本港收市比較，造價普遍向下。</p><p></p><p>滙豐控股收市折合139.76元，比本港收市低0.94元。工商銀行7.83元，與本港收市價持平。建設銀行10.39元，低5仙。友邦保險79.35元，高0.1元。港交所380.41元，低1.59元。</p><p></p><p>騰訊控股393.16元，低5.64元。阿里巴巴92.52元，低1.28元。理想汽車45.85元，低0.91元。金沙中國10.93元，低0.1元。長和68.95元，低0.4元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:04:23.276047+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T23:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T12:14:31.646846+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T23:57:40.943849+00:00","content_hash":"7dc68ebe688d43798f5dc59e1854e8ba00696cbbcb80853cb9f0607eec494120","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:04:23.276047+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}